BurnedTower_B1F_Text_Eusine::
    .string "SUICUNE looked at you before\n"
    .string "leaving. I will follow SUICUNE.\p"
    .string "Your records from KANTO helped\n"
    .string "us recognize these three lives.$"

BurnedTower_B1F_Text_Awakening::
    .string "Three POKEMON stir among the\n"
    .string "charred stones below the tower.$"

BurnedTower_B1F_Text_Escaped::
    .string "RAIKOU, ENTEI and SUICUNE rush\n"
    .string "out into the JOHTO countryside.\p"
    .string "MORTY: The old story was true.\n"
    .string "Meet me at the GYM.$"

BurnedTower_B1F_Text_MortyBefore::
    .string "MORTY: Step toward the old\n"
    .string "stones. Something is moving.$"

BurnedTower_B1F_Text_MortyReady::
    .string "MORTY: Meet me at the GYM.\n"
    .string "We have much to learn from you.$"

